{"story":{"id":"event-namarian-3","title":{"zh":"星海游牧民","en":"Galactic Nomads"},"category":"stories","kind":"event","image":"art/b5b6c7440ae71484e037.webp","start":"namarian.21","chapters":17,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"你们好，[Root.GetAdj][Root.GetRulerTitle]。我们有个请求。在我们穿过漫漫虚空的旅途中，我们中的一些人民心生倦怠，眼中失去了目标。我们不是暴君，因此不会强迫任何人跟随我们完成旅途。所以我们在此请求：你们可以接收上述船员吗？让他们栖息在你们的[NomadMissionPlanet.GetName]上，可以吗？","en":"Greetings again, [Root.GetAdj] [Root.GetRulerTitle]. We have a request for you. As we travel the void some of our people grow weary and lose sight of our goal. We are no tyrants, we force no one to see our quest to the end. So we ask of you: will you take some"},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1","n2","n3"]},"n1":{"doc":"namarian.21","parent":"n0","via":{"modified":true,"chance":0.3,"group":"c18067","delay":[{"days":"1"}],"hooks":["immediate","immediate","immediate"],"when":[[[{"type":"other","key":"exists","arg":"space_owner","scope":"from","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"default","scope":"from/space_owner","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_hostile","arg":"event_target:nomad_owner","scope":"from/space_owner","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"has_communications","arg":"event_target:nomad_owner","scope":"from/space_owner","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"exists","arg":"space_owner","scope":"from","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"fallen_empire","scope":"from/space_owner","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_hostile","arg":"event_target:nomad_owner","scope":"from/space_owner","value":false},{"type":"other","key":"has_communications","arg":"event_target:nomad_owner","scope":"from/space_owner","value":false}],[{"type":"other","key":"exists","arg":"space_owner","scope":"from","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_country_type","arg":"awakened_fallen_empire","scope":"from/space_owner","value":true},{"type":"other","key":"is_hostile","arg":"event_target:nomad_owner","scope":"